<section id="questions" class="app-section">
  <div class="app-shell">
    <div class="app-head">
      <h2 class="h2-sm">Questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="app-faq">
      <details>
        <summary>Does a coach listen to my voice notes?</summary>
        <p>Nobody listens to them. An AI adapts your plan inside rules a coach wrote. If you want one-to-one coaching, contact the coach directly.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What does it cost?</summary>
        <p>LSU Running is €19.99 a month and LSU Running + Strength is €29.99 a month, tax included. Subscribe in the app or on the <a href="/coaching#training">coaching page</a>, and cancel or resume from the Me tab.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Which sessions can it change?</summary>
        <p>Only sessions you have not done yet, in the subscription you sent the note from. Finished sessions and your history stay as they are, and every change has an undo.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Do I need a watch?</summary>
        <p>Your phone records GPS, and you can log any session by hand: duration, distance, average heart rate, effort out of ten and how it felt. A Bluetooth chest strap or a Garmin adds more detail.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What happens to my health data?</summary>
        <p>The app only reads the health data you allow, and only to plan your training. It is stored in Germany. Read the details in the <a href="https://training.lsu.stacksjs.com/legal/lsu/privacy">app privacy notice</a>.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

